OL,3,AHeading off to uni? Here's what to
OL,4,Ainsure against theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaptops, phones and bikes are top of
OL,7,Fthe shopping list for thieves as
OL,8,Fstudents head off to university,
OL,9,Faccording to insurer Aviva.
OL,11,FThey are the items most likely to be on
OL,12,Fstudent insurance claims - after being
OL,13,Fstolen from digs, cars, public
OL,14,Ftransport and bars and restaurants.
OL,16,FBut there are ways you can help keep
OL,17,Fthem safe, and things to consider if
OL,18,Fyou are planning to get insurance
OL,19,Fcover.
OL,21,FGet it wrong and it can be expensive,
OL,22,For possibly illegal.
